     3	 * by the pricing policy that owns it: a main item by the price list, a
     4	 * component by the flat component value.
     5	 *
     6	 * This is the one place that decides which valuation an item falls under. It
     7	 * is a separate decision from whether the MHPCO will cover the item at all:
     8	 * the office may take on a new kind of item without changing what the items it
     9	 * already covers are worth, and may revalue what it covers without widening
